<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of June 23 to June 27, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for a 10th consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   706.33 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  548.14 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 158.19 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     162.27 billion yen</p>
</text>
